  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed windows serving the northwest elevation, as illustrated by drawing number 9107-511 dated May 2024, shall be fitted with obscured glazing and apart from any top-hung light that has a sill height of not less than 1.7 metres above the internal finished floor level of the room it serves shall be non-opening. The windows shall thereafter be permanently retained as such.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
